        "name": "get_ecosystem",
        "title": "Nuru AI ecosystem status (real time)",
        "description": "Describe the live Nuru AI / Africa Opportunity Hub ecosystem: the AI departments and what each does, supported African languages and their capabilities, the Business Hub sectors and trade corridors, and real-time public counts of mapped problems and research (with top countries, categories and the newest published entries). Read-only and public data only.",
